{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"verdict\": \"both_partly\",\n  \"quotes\": [\n    \"The deep learning model achieved an average weighted F1 score of 0.67, a macro F1 score of 0.62 across eight trials from five participants and successfully detected 24/29 (80%) of FOG episodes.\",\n    \"In total, the testing sets contained data from 30 FOG episodes (169 seconds) across all trials (Table 2). The model successfully detected 24 (80%) of the 30 freezes across the cohort with a specificity of 55%.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"论文内部存在明确的数字不一致。摘要明确报告24/29（80%），支持指控者关于摘要数字的说法；但Results部分明确报告24/30（80%），与报告X正文的数字完全一致。因此，不能认定报告X的24/30完全没有原文依据，也不能否认其与摘要不一致。全文同时支持双方各自的一部分主张，故判定为both_partly。仅根据全文无法进一步判断后续审计是否发生，以及主文是否曾被要求统一修正。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "edd830e8-90e8-4878-9fc9-5fcebf20fb48", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T104658260906Z", "elapsed_seconds": 11.235, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T10:47:09.520825+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b986025d637a08565c01d837f4db16c77c49a8dcc8179e656affebacff7c1b92", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachmen